# Ignore everything except the staged LinuxServer build so `docker build` has a minimal context.
*
!Saved/
!Saved/StagedBuilds/
!Saved/StagedBuilds/LinuxServer/
!Saved/StagedBuilds/LinuxServer/**

# Not needed at runtime (a -NullRHI server never loads Vulkan, and symbols only matter for
# crash symbolication, which uses the zip in S3). Together they are ~2 GB of the 2.6 GB build.
Saved/StagedBuilds/LinuxServer/**/*.debug
Saved/StagedBuilds/LinuxServer/**/*.sym
Saved/StagedBuilds/LinuxServer/Engine/Binaries/ThirdParty/Vulkan/**
